mtllib materials/cat.mtl
o square
v 0 0 0     # Bottom left
v 1 0 0     # Bottom right
v 0 1 0     # Top left
v 1 1 0     # Top right
v 0.5 0.5 0 # Center
usemtl CatMaterial
f 3 4 2
f 3 5 1
f 5 1 2

# 7 unique couples of position-texture vertices
# should display a square with a texture, the lower part must be reversed